		\Big ( \tilde{M}^{W,\tilde{u}}_a \Big)_{\alice \alice' \alice''} \approx_{\delta_S} \Big ( \tilde{M}^{W,\tilde{u}}_a \Big)_{\bob \bob' \bob''}.
	\end{equation}
	This follows because on average over $u \in \F_q^m$ and $\tilde{u} \in \F_q^\nqubits$ we have
